# Claude Code machine-local overrides. Never commit this: it accumulates
# per-machine permission rules with absolute paths, and while it was tracked it
# conflicted on every `git pull` on the lab PC (2026-07-20 and 2026-07-30),
# blocking the deploy. Project-wide settings belong in .claude/settings.json.
